// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Darla Mavis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1324957723" "Darla Mavis"
// ProfessionString :
"P3288645287" "Former Heroine"
// DescriptionString :
"P2206548689" "As the heroine Maverick, Darla Mavis fought evil within the ranks of Longbow. Until friendly fire from a Sapper stole her powers, that is. Now, Darla styles herself Dark Maverick, and she's dedicated to nothing more than revenge against her former friends. Working with Darla is a good way to find yourself in plenty of dangerous situations, but it's also a good way to build a reputation."
// HelloString :
"P2999481528" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey. You ready to work?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3394001403" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's do some damage.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2132075504" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's rock this island.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1754235913" "We never met, kid. Go look up the brokers if you want people around here to trust you. They're on your map."
// FirstVisitString :
"P566199708" "{VillainName}. Guess I thought I'd be seeing you eventually. Your stock's been on the rise quite a bit lately, but I can help you turn that buzz into a full-blown cacophony. All you have to do is hurt a few people. Badly."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4245355968" "I told you to get out of here! Go!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1113216242" "You're a little too eager for more work, kid. Come back when you've got the time for me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4118020122" "There's something I want taken care of, but you'd only foul it up. Come back when you're Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2829880592" "Well, you've got guts, I'll say that. Maybe we can work together a while longer. Maybe I could even let you have a peek at some of my better <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> Call me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3427833938" "I think you've got what it takes, {VillainName}, as long as your good luck holds out. This is a profitable alliance. You should take a look at the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> I've got here."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P394924669" "Get!"
// LocationString :
"P2093761884" "Nerva Archipelago"
// IntroString :
"P305585281" "Have you met Darla Mavis yet? Believe it or not, she used to be a hero, until one of her own men accidentally sapped her powers for good. Now, she despises heroes. She'll be more than happy to help you take on Longbow and the Freedom Corps. That could really help your rep. Plus, she can get you Magic and Mutant Enhancements. Always a good deal."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2572320127" "Choose Darla Mavis"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3613884970" "Darla's a cynical snake, but she's smart. Just don't betray her."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P706514017" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Someone</a> I know wants an introduction."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1771657846" "I know some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> who want to work with you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


