// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Kristof Jaeger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2677589977" "Kristof Jaeger"
// ProfessionString :
"P2734562825" "Rogue Longbow Agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P507874830" "Kristof Jaeger was a long time Longbow Agent until he realized he liked playing on the other side of the fence. It started with Kristof taking bribes from various villain groups. It ended with Kristof being stripped of his rank within Longbow when his indiscretions resulted in the death of an entire squad of fellow agents. Now Kristof uses his Longbow intelligence training against his former employers whenever the opportunity presents itself."
// HelloString :
"P53704100" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Guten tag, {VillainName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P4066645975" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Greetings.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3554358586" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hello.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P132550883" "Do I know you? No? Then I suggest you move along."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1391149388" "Before we go any further, let me get something straight. Yes, I used to be a Longbow agent, but I'm done with that now. Let's just say they didn't like some of the side deals I was making. Whatever. I've moved on to bigger and more profitable things now. You follow my lead, and I can cut you in on the big score as well."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1490271589" "Our business is done, {VillainName}."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P31937021" "You're far too busy for the work I have lined up. Come talk to me when you've got more time, {VillainName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2668592515" "I need someone at Threat Level {Level}. You can't handle what I've got lined up."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P224039283" "You hate Longbow? I sure do. Prove to me you're not with them, and we can do business."
// BadgeFirstTick :
"P128443048" "Are you sure you're not working with Longbow? You've hardly done a thing against them."
// BadgeSecondTick :
"P3092240589" "Yeah, you've taken down a few agents. But I'm not convinced you're really against them."
// BadgeFourthTick :
"P1504440122" "Yeah, I can tell you've taken down a lot of Longbow. A few more, and I'll be convinced."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P997268210" "You're a real trooper. You might make it through this. If you're going to survive, though, you'll need the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> Call on me, ok?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2152063244" "You're a hardcore soldier, {VillainName}. You got the right stuff. Just make sure you don't let yourself go without the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2271348040" "It's time to move on, {VillainName}. I've got nothing more for you."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2406197103" "Kristof Jaeger is a true mercenary. I heard he's an ex-Longbow Agent, but now works for whoever can afford his services. Kristof has access to Technology and Science Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3473755855" "Choose Kristof Jaeger"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2520913902" "Kristof is working on a big score. From what I heard of him, it'll probably have to do with blowing up something."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2283976122" "There's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1382128211" "I know some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> you should meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


