"P3698200134" "Shadowy Figure"
// ProfessionString :
"P1806910968" "Street Fixer"
// DescriptionString :
"P3395244653" "This shadowy figure sticks to the shadows of the alleyway. No one knows who he really is, but those in the know hear he's got the pulse on what's going down in Crimson Cove."
// HelloString :
"P586987227" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Psst. Hey buddy.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1339696590" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>C'mere.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2040707534" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Got somethin' for ya.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4060663009" "I don't know you, pal. That won't change unless you build up your reputation with the brokers. They're on your map."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2860133727" "Let me get some things straight: you don't know me, you never saw me, we never met. Clear? Okay, let's get down to business."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1387445304" "I got nothin' for you. Now go away, you're drawing attention."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P582685500" "You got too much goin' on, {VillainName}. Come back later."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2050701173" "Word on the street is that you ain't got a rep to speak of. Come back when you're at least Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P473738589" "{VillainName}, you're a slick one to work with. You need <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements?</a> Call on me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1721204522" "{VillainName}, I think I can trust you with some of my juicier secrets. And with some of my sweeter <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements,</a> too."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1798638796" "You're too high-profile for me to work with, {VillainName}. You draw too much attention."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3312157093" "I know a guy that hangs out in the alleys of Crimson Cove in the Nerva Archipelago. I don't actually know his name, but he's a good source of information on what's going down in that part of the world. I hear he can get you Natural and Technology Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2952672979" "Choose Shadowy Figure"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3898735641" "He's kinda paranoid, but his information is solid."
